	(text "osuPad Hall Effect (Rapid Trigger) input module V1 - two DRV5055 linear Hall sensors" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 160.02 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "b4f00e0c-cfed-5856-b463-37a1514039cf"))
	(text "Module connector pinout, identical on every osuPad input module:" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 164.08 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "ff30c478-1ac1-5193-98a6-78193f271a70"))
	(text "1 3V3 | 2 GND | 3 IN1 = GPIO10 (ADC1_CH9) | 4 IN2 = GPIO7 (ADC1_CH6) | 5 ID = GPIO8 (ADC1_CH7) | 6 GPIO6 | 7 GPIO4 | 8 GPIO2" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 168.14 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "c29bb5d1-a5c0-5f5c-b350-62f37848491b"))
	(text "U1/U2 output a ratiometric analog voltage centred on VCC/2; the firmware tracks the peak and applies the rapid-trigger threshold." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 172.20 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "95c4fdcf-bd28-52ec-bde4-5dc6137361b7"))
	(text "Module ID: 3V3 x 47k / (100k + 47k) = 1.06 V, read on GPIO8 and decoded as "Hall Effect module V1"." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 176.26 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "c61be83e-5948-5bc0-8188-0911fbdecf94"))
	(text "Everything is on the bottom side. U1 and U2 sit on the key centres over solid FR-4, with no copper pour in the magnetic path." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 180.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "b6d16186-b6d9-5e07-b4bd-db60d84a87eb"))
	(text "J1-6/7/8 are reserved for an SPI variant and are brought out to probe pads TP1..TP3 instead of being left floating." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 184.38 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "354acdcb-f26c-5727-bf92-c5cb5d217fd9"))
